  "reasoning": "The facts describe that the defendant Liu purchased a rare earth mine, and together with an accomplice, extracted rare earth minerals without obtaining a mining permit, using illegal methods. This conduct constitutes illegal mining (非法采矿) under Article 338 of the Criminal Law, which penalizes mining activities without the required permits and causing damage to mineral resources. No other distinct criminal conduct is described, so only this offense applies.",
